gitleaks
https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks

The rule pack at crates/siloscan-core/rules/default/secrets.yaml is a
translation of the gitleaks default configuration. It was generated by
scripts/convert_gitleaks.py from:

  tag:    v8.30.1
  source: config/gitleaks.toml
  url:    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gitleaks/gitleaks/v8.30.1/config/gitleaks.toml

Rule identifiers, detection patterns, descriptions, keywords, entropy
thresholds and allowlists are derived from that file. Rules relying on gitleaks
features siloscan cannot express were omitted; no patterns were rewritten.

